1
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:35,120
But why do I feel like

2
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:38,479
you don't really want her to get out?

3
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,160
What do you mean by that?

4
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:44,240
You should know exactly what I mean.

5
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:46,690
Lawyer Xiao.

6
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,979
I have a clear conscience.

7
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,280
How I treat Huihui,

8
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,600
everyone knows.

9
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,160
I run around all day.

10
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,039
Who is it for?

11
00:01:54,039 --> 00:01:55,160
If you say that,

12
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:58,360
you really have no conscience.

13
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,160
I misspoke.

14
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:04,040
Yu Huihui having a husband like you

15
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:06,420
is a blessing she earned in this life.

16
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,560
Come on, drink up.

17
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:23,360
Come on.

18
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:24,560
Okay.

19
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,680
One more.

20
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:32,440
Sister, there's definitely something wrong with Zhou Huan.

21
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:35,240
He's just like the King of Hell posting a notice.

22
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,240
Full of nonsense.

23
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,440
I don't think he wants to save Yu Huihui at all.

24
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:39,680
Even you can tell.

25
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:42,560
The key is how much Yu Huihui actually knows.

26
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,160
We don't know that.

27
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:45,960
Are you a ghost?

28
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:48,720
Sneaking around the door every day. What are you doing?

29
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:50,520
You're way too hostile.

30
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,520
I was thinking of discussing something with you.

31
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,960
What? You want free advice again?

32
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:54,520
No way.

33
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,600
Was that guy who just went downstairs your client?

34
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,460
Do you know him?

35
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,160
I saw him once at Jia Xin's.

36
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,720
He sings terribly. Just howling.

37
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:02,240
He knows Jia Xin?

38
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:04,240
More than just acquaintances.

39
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,440
What else do you know?

40
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:08,290
Information is meant to be exchanged.

41
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:08,800
Come, bro.

42
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,520
Get him a seat, quick.

43
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,160
Sit. Please sit.

44
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,090
Please sit, bro.

45
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,920
Let me give you a massage.

46
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,080
Mr. Dong.

47
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,530
What do you want to ask? Tell me.

48
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,079
I mainly want to ask.

49
00:03:19,079 --> 00:03:19,540
You see,

50
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,540
I've been with Jia Xin for so long.

51
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,520
But this bastard

52
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,800
is obviously on guard against me.

53
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,520
He's even afraid I'll hear him fart.

54
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:28,040
So I'm thinking about how to make him talk.

55
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,079
Think about it.

56
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,960
When is Jia Xin most relaxed?

57
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:36,170
When he's sleeping.

58
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:38,400
Are you dense?

59
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,600
I'm sorry, Mr. Dong.

60
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,040
I mean,

61
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,040
you have to think about

62
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:51,280
when he is least on guard against you.

63
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,660
Least on guard against me?

64
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,160
I got it.

65
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,000
Understood.

66
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,440
Intel.

67
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:06,320
That's it.

68
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:07,780
What do you mean that's it?

69
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,290
He's working at Jiaxin's company now.

70
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,840
Does that count as intel?

71
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,560
That bastard.

72
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,839
He really is a fraud.

73
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,320
You guys can leave first.

74
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,260
Ms. Zhong, please have a seat.

75
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,130
What can I do for you?

76
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:58,440
You went to see Mr. Shao alone.

77
00:04:58,440 --> 00:04:59,040
Yes.

78
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,560
I wanted Chairman Shao

79
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:02,320
to be in a more neutral environment

80
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,800
and learn about other options.

81
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:04,840
Lawyer Qiu said

82
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:07,240
we could clearly plead not guilty.

83
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,400
Why do you always want us to plead guilty and accept punishment?

84
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,520
Whose lawyer are you exactly?

85
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,840
Whose side are you on?

86
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,960
If Mr. Shao gets sentenced to eight or ten years...

87
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:14,600
What about our family?

88
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,400
What about me?

89
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:16,400
Have you ever thought about it?

90
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:18,600
What if a not-guilty plea doesn't work?

91
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:21,000
An excellent criminal defense lawyer

92
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,280
must have the mindset to break the deadlock.

93
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:25,880
Only by completely stepping out of the prosecution's logic of guilt

94
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:28,040
can we see the facts more comprehensively

95
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,370
and protect our client.

96
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:32,440
But I also completely understand Lawyer Li's concerns.

97
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:34,720
Local lawyers in the local network

98
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:37,280
do find it hard to act freely, right?

99
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,200
Lawyer Li.

100
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:41,840
I heard your father is a retired police officer

101
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:44,440
and handled Old Shao's case before, right?

102
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,400
Is that so?

103
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,440
Why didn't you say so earlier, Lawyer Li?

104
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:50,200
Then it's better for you to recuse yourself.

105
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,200
Ms. Zhong.

106
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:53,200
My father's profession

107
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:55,800
has nothing to do with my professional stance.

108
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:00,040
You were recommended by Director Wang.

109
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,600
I'm doing this out of respect for him.

110
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,280
But Lawyer Li, let me tell you this.

111
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:07,400
I hope you cooperate well with Lawyer Qiu.

112
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:10,540
Otherwise, I'll let him take over alone.

113
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,060
Think about it carefully.

114
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,900
Why is there such a big commotion?

115
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,520
Sorry, Director.

116
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,760
As lawyers,

117
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,720
sometimes we don't deal with cases,

118
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:56,040
but people.

119
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:59,540
If you can't handle people, you can't handle cases.

120
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:02,520
Lawyer Qiu is quite good at this.

121
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,280
You should learn from him.

122
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:09,280
Then I'd have to go to a drama academy to study acting.

123
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,400
I'm being serious.

124
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,520
This is a rare major case in this area.

125
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,640
Countless eyes are watching.

126
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:18,400
If handled well, it'll be Honghu's calling card.

127
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:21,260
If not, we'll be the laughingstock of the industry.

128
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,080
Go back and think about it carefully.

129
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:26,010
This matter needs to be resolved as soon as possible.

130
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:29,280
Lawyer Xiao.

131
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,720
The supplementary evidence you requested

132
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:32,159
has been obtained from the bank

133
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:33,520
and burned onto this CD.

134
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:35,159
Thank you.

135
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:02,200
Hello, Uncle Yu.

136
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:04,760
I have something to discuss with you in person.

137
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:05,520
Is it convenient for me to come to you?

138
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,280
No need. Don't come to me.

139
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,940
I was just about to go find you.

140
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,160
Okay.

141
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,640
It's getting dark.

142
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,280
Why aren't Uncle Yu and the others here yet?

143
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,410
Will Zhou Huan be the one coming again?

144
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:31,840
Uncle, what does this mean?

145
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:32,960
What do you think I mean?

146
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,640
Don't you know what you've done?

147
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,520
Why is this lawyer so mean?

148
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:36,600
What are your intentions?

149
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,559
We had a good agreement when we first got here.

150
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:40,159
Why are you acting like this?

151
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,919
No, what did I do?

152
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,720
Can we make things clear?

153
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:47,680
Is it possible to negotiate with the court?

154
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:48,920
It's very likely.

155
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:50,160
But 1.2 million

156
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:52,000
is too difficult for our family.

157
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,360
Is it possible to make it less?

158
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,680
Not a penny less.

159
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:56,560
The evidence is right here.

160
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,600
What else do you have to say?

161
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,000
Lawyers like you,

162
00:08:59,000 --> 00:08:59,480
let me tell you,

163
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,520
just take advantage of others' difficulties

164
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:01,760
and find ways to cheat the defendant's family out of their money.

165
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:03,120
No, you've wronged a good person.

166
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:05,120
When did we ever wrong a good person?

167
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:07,890
Alright, stop arguing.

168
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:09,120
It's just a recording.

169
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,800
I have one too. Want to hear it?

170
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:15,240
If we pay it back, is bail guaranteed?

171
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:18,360
No one can guarantee it 100%.

172
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:20,800
I can only say it's highly likely.

173
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,240
Is it possible to pay less?

174
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,600
No, it can't.

175
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:25,940
Not a single cent less.

176
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:29,360
Is it possible to negotiate with the court?

177
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:31,800
Zhou Huan, let me remind you of something.

178
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:35,000
Interfering with judicial justice is crossing the red line.

179
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,680
Do you understand, Uncle?

180
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:39,800
That recording was pieced together by Zhou Huan himself.

181
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,460
Fortunately, I kept a backup.

182
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,920
Zhou Huan also told me

183
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:46,720
that Hui's aunt was sick and needed a liver transplant,

184
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:48,920
so she couldn't afford to return the stolen money.

185
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,250
I'm perfectly healthy.

186
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,680
When did I ever need a liver transplant?

187
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,560
Don't you get it yet?

188
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,920
You were tricked by him.

189
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,240
Also, Uncle,

190
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:57,240
At Anding Wealth Management, Yu Huihui

191
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,800
embezzled 1.2 million.

192
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:00,680
Zhou Huan didn't tell you about this either, did he?

193
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,480
That money should still be with Zhou Huan.

194
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,480
That's why I asked you to come today.

195
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,400
That can't be.

196
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:07,360
Zhou Huan just sent me a message,

197
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,360
saying he went out of town

198
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:10,480
to help Huihui raise money and pull strings.

199
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:12,240
Uncle, why don't you understand?

200
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,600
He's putting on an act for you.

201
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,720
He's just a pure scammer.

202
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:19,840
Then how could Zhou Huan be like this?

203
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:23,840
I guess he knew from the beginning

204
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,840
that Anding Wealth Management was a scam company.

205
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:28,120
So he got out before it blew up,

206
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:30,220
leaving Huihui to take the blame.

207
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,200
Then why did he still lead me to find

208
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,040
a lawyer?

209
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:36,000
He probably thought I was one of those

210
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,480
small-time lawyers handing out cards at the hospital,

211
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,640
definitely unreliable,

212
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:40,440
and unable to see through his scam.

213
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,370
He didn't expect

214
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:42,880
me to keep holding onto this matter.

215
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,040
So he came up with a trick

216
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,640
to have you come make a scene here,

217
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:47,040
so he could get away.

218
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,160
Also, Uncle,

219
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,400
Zhou Huan is now at

220
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:51,280
a new wealth management company.

221
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:53,520
So this was all planned by him.

222
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,520
Brother, he is a scammer.

223
00:10:58,520 --> 00:10:59,560
Let's go find him.

224
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:02,160
Uncle, we can't tip him off.

225
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:03,880
Since he could go this far,

226
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:05,480
it means he has thought of countermeasures.

227
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:07,120
Even if we go, it's useless.

228
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,480
He won't admit it.

229
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,880
Then tell me, what should we

230
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:11,280
do about this?

231
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:13,760
Uncle, the trial is about to start.

232
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:16,640
The most important thing is to get Yu Huihui to tell the truth.

233
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:18,900
Only then can her punishment be reduced.

234
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,280
Lawyer Xiao,

235
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,040
I beg you again.

236
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,160
You must think of a way.

237
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:25,160
Please save my Huihui.

238
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:25,640
Yes, Lawyer Xiao.

239
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:26,640
We beg you.

240
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:29,400
Don't worry, Uncle. I will definitely do my best.

241
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:31,280
Thank you, Lawyer Xiao.

242
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:36,080
Your husband told me everything about you two.

243
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,360
About what?

244
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:40,640
About what you did at Anding Wealth Management.

245
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:43,480
He said he planned everything himself,

246
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,010
including the 1.2 million.

247
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:46,480
He also told you to transfer it,

248
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,240
didn't he?

249
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:49,480
He even told you that?

250
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,480
And there's more.

251
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,480
He said you two agreed

252
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,560
not to return the stolen money.

253
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:56,080
You'd take the blame, serve five years in prison,

254
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,740
and then you two would be rich.

255
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,480
Five years?

256
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:02,240
Didn't my husband say two years?

257
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,580
Strange, isn't it?

258
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,760
Because Zhou Huan is lying to you.

259
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,800
You don't have to look at me like that,

260
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,520
Yu Huihui.

261
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:15,680
As a professional lawyer, I'm telling you,

262
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:18,000
if you don't return the stolen money under these circumstances,

263
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,000
you'll face combined punishment for multiple crimes when the case reaches the procuratorate.

264
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,060
Five years would be a light sentence.

265
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:24,200
Impossible.

266
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:27,800
Zhou Huan never intended to save you.

267
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:30,320
He just wanted you to take the blame for him.

268
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,400
He transferred that money away a long time ago.

269
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:34,080
He won't wait for you to get out.

270
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:34,680
Sis.

271
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,040
No.

272
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:39,280
My husband wouldn't do this to me.

273
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:41,040
Your husband? Where is he?

274
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,400
Are you two married?

275
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,160
Your dad told me everything.

276
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:47,040
You two aren't married.

277
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:51,480
Zhou Huan kept saying he was too ashamed to marry you without buying a house.

278
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:54,160
He used that as an excuse to keep delaying the wedding.

279
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:56,160
Can't you see through his scheme?

280
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:59,400
As long as this money isn't joint marital property...

281
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:02,040
He could run away with the money at any time.

282
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:03,280
That's impossible.

283
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:05,680
Sister, you don't know him.

284
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,480
He loves me very much.

285
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:10,160
He said the first time he saw me,

286
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:12,640
he felt I was the right one.

287
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,880
He treats me so well.

288
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:17,040
He doesn't even let me do housework.

289
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:20,040
I'm not showing off.

290
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:23,040
Even my toenails

291
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:25,520
are cut by my husband.

292
00:13:25,880 --> 00:13:28,360
He's not just good to me.

293
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:30,280
He's also very good to my dad.

294
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,280
When my dad was in the hospital,

295
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:35,280
he ran around and lost a lot of weight.

296
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,640
You know, he's

297
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,280
very pitiful.

298
00:13:39,560 --> 00:13:41,520
He grew up without parents.

299
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:43,600
He really wants a family,

300
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:47,080
and I can give him one.

301
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,760
What can you give him?

302
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:51,000
Why is he pitiful, Yu Huihui?

303
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,130
Why do you believe everything he says?

304
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:55,120
Sister.

305
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:59,240
Have you ever truly loved someone?

306
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:06,360
You definitely haven't.

307
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:09,360
So you don't understand love.

308
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:11,440
Love is about 100% trust.

309
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,920
Am I wrong?

310
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:16,240
Since his love for you is 100%

311
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,120
and he trusts you,

312
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,760
why are you the one sitting in here

313
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:19,880
and not him?

314
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,560
Since he loves you so much,

315
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:24,240
why did he lie to you that it's two years instead of five?

316
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,880
Why did he say your aunt is sick

317
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:27,240
and can't return the stolen money?

318
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,520
Why did he use that recording

319
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:30,120
to fool your dad?

320
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,880
Zhou Huan doesn't love you at all.

321
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,760
He's just using you.

322
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:40,880
No, that's definitely not true.

323
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:42,760
My husband wouldn't treat me like this.

324
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:44,160
Let's not talk about him.

325
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:45,360
Let's talk about you.

326
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,690
You might not know this,

327
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,760
but your dad is so worried about you

328
00:14:49,880 --> 00:14:51,640
that his hair has turned white.

329
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:54,880
Your aunt can't eat or sleep well,

330
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:57,280
and she's going to get sick from worrying.

331
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:58,880
Your whole family

332
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,520
is so worried about you.

333
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:03,240
Do you have the heart to see them like this?

334
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:05,700
You just decided to go to jail for five years.

335
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,520
Have you ever thought about it?

336
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:08,520
After you go in,

337
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:09,280
to put it bluntly,

338
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:10,360
when you come out,

339
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:12,220
will you still be able to see them?

340
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,120
Yu Huihui.

341
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:18,760
I might not be able to wake you up by scolding you.

342
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:19,520
That's fine.

343
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,530
But I want to remind you,

344
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:25,090
this is the last time we'll meet before the trial.

345
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:28,000
I hope you can think carefully

346
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:30,240
about everything I've said.

347
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,640
If you can tell the truth

348
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:33,880
during the trial,

349
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:37,370
your sentence could be reduced by more than half.

350
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:39,000
Do you want to

351
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:41,520
believe a man full of lies,

352
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:44,360
or believe the truth and the law?

353
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:58,000
Our profession looks glamorous.

354
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:00,700
It's actually a high-end service industry.

355
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:03,960
The core purpose is to serve the clients well.

356
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:05,760
Right, Lawyer Li?

357
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:07,000
Right.

358
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,240
So,

359
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:11,760
there's no need to complicate things.

360
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:14,400
Since the client wants to plead not guilty,

361
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,960
why are we fighting it, right?

362
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:19,240
As long as you're on the same page as me,

363
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:20,120
with this case,

364
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:22,120
I can still bring you on board.

365
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,200
Thank you, Lawyer Qiu.

366
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:27,680
What do you plan to do next?

367
00:16:27,680 --> 00:16:28,400
And

368
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:30,280
what can I do?

369
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:31,720
Great.

370
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,920
The local connections and relationships,

371
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:35,000
you know them better than I do.

372
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,600
But I know your personality.

373
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:38,600
How about this: you make the introductions.

374
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,680
Leave the communication to me.

375
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:40,920
Let's work together.

376
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:45,540
This is what Chairman Shao wants.

377
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:49,920
I heard you just made senior partner.

378
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:51,920
The performance pressure must be high, right?

379
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:53,250
Broaden your thinking.

380
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,200
Win-win.

381
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:57,800
Understood.

382
00:16:58,400 --> 00:16:59,160
Win-win.

383
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:01,920
Win-win.

384
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:05,260
The coffee is good.

385
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:08,680
Tastes a bit like Ethiopian Yirgacheffe.

386
00:17:09,599 --> 00:17:12,280
I can tell Attorney Qiu knows coffee.

387
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:14,280
Right, because I'm not used to domestic brands.

388
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:15,359
Nescafé instant.

389
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:19,119
Imported Nescafé instant, right?

390
00:17:19,119 --> 00:17:20,160
Yes, imported.

391
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:21,280
Please.

392
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:24,240
Don't forget what I told you.

393
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:25,280
Win-win.

394
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,040
No need to see me out.

395
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:28,440
Take care, Attorney Qiu.

396
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:34,880
Director.

397
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:37,360
I've figured it out.

398
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:40,040
I've figured it out. It's a win-win.

399
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:45,280
Lawyer Li.

400
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:48,370
Your appointment at the detention center is set.

401
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,160
Lawyer Li.

402
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:51,200
Are you going to meet your client?

403
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,160
Let me go with you.

404
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:53,520
I can play good cop or bad cop.

405
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:54,800
If push comes to shove, I'll even kneel down for him.

406
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:56,000
No, no, no. You're too expensive.

407
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,330
I'll kneel down for him.

408
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:00,240
Lawyer Li, wait.

409
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:02,370
The contract you asked for is printed.

410
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:08,800
Did I read that wrong?

411
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,360
Why is it a termination of representation?

412
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:12,890
You didn't read it wrong. It is a termination.

413
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:15,640
Do you think Lawyer Li has gone mad from anger?

414
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,160
I don't know if he's angry.

415
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:19,280
But he's definitely gone mad.

416
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:21,040
When people are under a lot of pressure,

417
00:18:21,040 --> 00:18:22,360
they can do anything.

418
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,880
Unbelievable.

419
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:38,460
Leyang.

420
00:18:51,360 --> 00:18:53,000
Why did you come alone again?

421
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:55,760
Didn't Lawyer Qiu make my intentions clear to you?

422
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:56,960
He made it very clear.

423
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:59,380
So this is the last time I'll come.

424
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:03,730
What do you mean?

425
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:04,720
Nothing.

426
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,040
I'm quite busy too.

427
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:07,640
Let's not waste each other's time.

428
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:10,200
I explained the pros and cons clearly last time.

429
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:12,600
I don't work with people who don't trust me.

430
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,730
You're retreating to advance.

431
00:19:23,280 --> 00:19:24,040
Mr. Shao.

432
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:27,080
I'll refund the legal fees in full. I won't keep a single cent.

433
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:29,080
If there are no issues, just sign it.

434
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:37,320
Aren't you afraid of getting a bad reputation if word gets out?

435
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:40,120
Will anyone trust you in the future?

436
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:45,040
Let me put it this way.

437
00:19:45,520 --> 00:19:48,120
Whether I take this case or not,

438
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:50,560
win or lose,

439
00:19:50,840 --> 00:19:53,320
I'll still be a lawyer.

440
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,660
But you're different.

441
00:19:58,360 --> 00:19:59,690
Are you threatening me?

442
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:01,760
I never threaten anyone.

443
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:49,620
Let me tell you.

444
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,520
Let's get together after this is settled.

445
00:20:51,520 --> 00:20:52,880
You still have the nerve to come here.

446
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:55,200
Aren't you afraid of being struck by lightning?

447
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,260
Order in the court.

448
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:57,970
What kind of person are you?

449
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:10,330
The court is now in session.

450
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:13,080
Summon the defendant, Yu Huihui, to the court.

451
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,800
Huihui, Huihui.

452
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:20,240
It's okay.

453
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:21,680
I'm here.

454
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:30,360
Don't worry.

455
00:21:35,320 --> 00:21:38,600
The defense counsel may now question the defendant.

456
00:21:39,120 --> 00:21:40,800
Yu Huihui, let me ask you.

457
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:43,280
The 1.2 million mentioned by the prosecutor,

458
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:45,280
how did you transfer it at that time?

459
00:21:46,360 --> 00:21:47,320
I just

460
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:51,560
transferred it from the company's account

461
00:21:51,760 --> 00:21:53,840
to my bank card.

462
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:55,960
Did you decide to do this yourself,

463
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:58,500
or did your husband instruct you to do it?

464
00:21:58,520 --> 00:21:59,520
Defense counsel.

465
00:21:59,520 --> 00:22:01,760
The personal information of the defendant Yu Huihui shows...

466
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:03,800
Her marital status is unmarried,

467
00:22:03,800 --> 00:22:04,520
yet you claim

468
00:22:04,520 --> 00:22:07,480
that Yu Huihui's actions were instigated by her husband.

469
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:09,280
Please clarify what you mean.

470
00:22:10,040 --> 00:22:10,760
Your Honor,

471
00:22:11,520 --> 00:22:13,480
the defendant Yu Huihui is unmarried.

472
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:15,720
Her so-called husband is just her boyfriend,

473
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:17,760
who is sitting in the gallery,

474
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:19,960
Zhou Huan, posing as a victim.

475
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:22,960
Zhou Huan also used to work at Anding Wealth Management.

476
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:23,960
During that time,

477
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:26,760
he pursued my client, Yu Huihui,

478
00:22:26,800 --> 00:22:28,760
and they became a couple.

479
00:22:28,840 --> 00:22:31,480
Later, Zhou Huan resigned and hid behind the scenes,

480
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:33,880
instigating Yu Huihui to embezzle the stolen money.

481
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:36,720
When the stolen money was transferred to Yu Huihui's bank account,

482
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:37,960
the very next day,

483
00:22:38,080 --> 00:22:39,760
Zhou Huan and Yu Huihui

484
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:42,000
went to the bank together to withdraw cash.

485
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:44,000
Please play the video for the court.

486
00:22:46,880 --> 00:22:49,280
Based on their relationship, it is reasonable to infer that

487
00:22:49,280 --> 00:22:50,760
after withdrawing the cash,

488
00:22:50,760 --> 00:22:52,760
the defendant handed the money over to Zhou Huan.

489
00:22:52,760 --> 00:22:55,280
Zhou Huan embezzled and hid it,

490
00:22:55,280 --> 00:22:58,080
and instructed Yu Huihui to take the blame for him.

491
00:22:58,080 --> 00:23:00,610
Your Honor, the prosecutor reminds the court

492
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:03,320
that what the defense counsel said is entirely her personal speculation,

493
00:23:03,320 --> 00:23:04,680
unsupported by any evidence.

494
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:05,480
Your Honor,

495
00:23:05,520 --> 00:23:08,280
please allow me to continue questioning my client.

496
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:08,960
Granted.

497
00:23:09,040 --> 00:23:11,200
Yu Huihui, I ask you again,

498
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,860
where is the stolen money now?

499
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:16,760
Lawyer Xiao is asking you a question.

500
00:23:16,760 --> 00:23:17,960
Speak up.

501
00:23:17,960 --> 00:23:19,240
You're making me so anxious.

502
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:20,280
Just tell the truth.

503
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:21,080
Exactly.

504
00:23:21,800 --> 00:23:23,240
Order in the court.

505
00:23:23,280 --> 00:23:24,480
Keep quiet.

506
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:26,140
Why do you keep looking at him?

507
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:37,080
Huihui,

508
00:23:38,080 --> 00:23:39,480
I will always love you.

509
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,920
Love you for a lifetime.

510
00:23:52,040 --> 00:23:53,520
I love you.

511
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:05,560
I'm not sure.

512
00:24:05,560 --> 00:24:06,480
Defendant.

513
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,280
Defendant Yu Huihui.

514
00:24:07,280 --> 00:24:07,360
Defendant.

515
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:09,960
In front of your father and all your relatives.

516
00:24:10,040 --> 00:24:12,200
I hope you make a rational choice

517
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:14,040
and tell the truth to the court.

518
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:17,080
Does Zhou Huan have anything to do with this money?

519
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:28,200
No, he doesn't.

520
00:24:31,080 --> 00:24:32,920
Yu Huihui, have you thought this through?

521
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:35,240
Are you sure you want to trust this scammer,

522
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,720
ignoring your elderly father

523
00:24:36,720 --> 00:24:38,480
and all the family members who care about you?

524
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:39,440
Objection, Your Honor.

525
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:41,640
The defender's question is irrelevant to the facts of the case.

526
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:44,680
Defender, please focus your questions on the facts

527
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:48,400
and evidence of this case.

528
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:57,440
Yu Huihui, I will ask you one last time.

529
00:24:57,960 --> 00:25:01,480
From receiving the funds involved to the money disappearing,

530
00:25:02,440 --> 00:25:04,560
were you the only one handling it?

531
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:08,800
Defendant.

532
00:25:08,800 --> 00:25:10,860
From beginning to end, it was only me.

533
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:13,780
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

534
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,300
I plead guilty.

535
00:25:18,560 --> 00:25:20,240
You are such a foolish child.

536
00:25:23,840 --> 00:25:25,320
Silence in the gallery.

537
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:32,800
Bastard.

538
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,010
Uncle, listen to me.

539
00:25:34,080 --> 00:25:35,800
I have always cared about Huihui.

540
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:37,280
Otherwise, I wouldn't be here today.

541
00:25:37,280 --> 00:25:38,800
You came to threaten her.

542
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,850
You are afraid she will turn you in.

543
00:25:40,920 --> 00:25:42,000
Do you think anyone is that stupid?

544
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:43,320
You scumbag. Bastard.

545
00:25:43,320 --> 00:25:44,560
Have you no conscience?

546
00:25:44,560 --> 00:25:45,800
Aunt, Uncle.

547
00:25:45,800 --> 00:25:46,520
Yes.

548
00:25:47,120 --> 00:25:48,480
I understand how you feel.

549
00:25:48,480 --> 00:25:50,280
I am just as worried about Huihui as you are.

550
00:25:50,280 --> 00:25:51,600
You know how I treat her.

551
00:25:51,600 --> 00:25:53,320
You can't wrong an innocent person.

552
00:25:53,320 --> 00:25:55,000
Stop shedding crocodile tears here.

553
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:56,200
Uncle, don't hit him.

554
00:25:56,800 --> 00:25:57,320
Come on.

555
00:25:57,320 --> 00:25:58,960
He didn't even touch you, and you're acting again.

556
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:00,020
Are you hurt again?

557
00:26:00,360 --> 00:26:02,480
Lawyer Xiao, thank you for earlier.

558
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,280
I thank you on behalf of Huihui.

559
00:26:04,280 --> 00:26:05,800
Why are you so addicted to acting?

560
00:26:05,800 --> 00:26:07,240
Are you still in character?

561
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,400
You don't need to thank me.

562
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,560
When you go to prison to serve your sentence,

563
00:26:09,560 --> 00:26:11,960
there will be plenty of time to write me a thank-you letter.

564
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:12,560
Thank you.

565
00:26:12,720 --> 00:26:14,880
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

566
00:26:16,280 --> 00:26:17,280
Uncle.

567
00:26:17,280 --> 00:26:18,440
You bastard.

568
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:19,700
We can't break the law.

569
00:26:19,760 --> 00:26:22,520
Lawyer Xiao, please save Huihui.

570
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:24,520
My child is just foolish.

571
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:26,320
She was deceived by that bastard.

572
00:26:26,320 --> 00:26:27,960
If you don't save her,

573
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:31,000
she will have to go to jail.

574
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:33,240
Uncle, please get up.

575
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:33,960
Get up.

576
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:39,000
Terminating the contract?

577
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:40,800
Is this what you've figured out?

578
00:26:41,760 --> 00:26:43,360
The client doesn't trust me.

579
00:26:44,160 --> 00:26:47,820
I don't think it's necessary for me to continue representing him.

580
00:26:49,600 --> 00:26:51,000
If the client doesn't trust you,

581
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:53,520
shouldn't you try your best to win his trust?

582
00:26:53,520 --> 00:26:54,280
Mentor.

583
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:57,800
You can never wake up a person who is pretending to be asleep.

584
00:26:57,800 --> 00:26:59,000
And just like you said,

585
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:00,120
this case is so big,

586
00:27:00,120 --> 00:27:01,360
and has drawn so much attention.

587
00:27:01,360 --> 00:27:03,360
If we continue to plead not guilty,

588
00:27:03,800 --> 00:27:06,000
we will really become a joke in court.

589
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:07,680
That acting student doesn't care.

590
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:08,520
Once the lawsuit is over,

591
00:27:08,520 --> 00:27:10,680
he'll catch a flight somewhere else to perform.

592
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:13,280
He doesn't care at all about the verdict.

593
00:27:13,520 --> 00:27:14,850
But Honghu can't leave.

594
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:17,560
We can't just do a one-time deal.

595
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:20,810
Still, you shouldn't be so impulsive.

596
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:23,380
Isn't there a more comprehensive solution?

597
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:28,280
Your team already has three

598
00:27:28,320 --> 00:27:30,320
major clients about to sign

599
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:32,960
who have asked to review the contracts again.

600
00:27:33,800 --> 00:27:34,930
These three clients

601
00:27:35,280 --> 00:27:37,520
are your biggest source of revenue this year.

602
00:27:37,520 --> 00:27:38,480
If you lose them,

603
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:40,400
you won't meet the annual performance target,

604
00:27:40,400 --> 00:27:43,560
and you'll lose your senior partner position before you even settle in.

605
00:27:43,560 --> 00:27:45,420
Now that you're in this position,

606
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:47,680
you need to consider the big picture:

607
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:50,240
your team, your reputation,

608
00:27:50,600 --> 00:27:52,260
and your career development.

609
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:54,480
You're a senior partner now.

610
00:27:54,840 --> 00:27:57,640
You need to be careful with your words and actions.

611
00:29:33,880 --> 00:29:35,800
This client really pissed me off.

612
00:29:35,800 --> 00:29:37,040
Drove me crazy.

613
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:39,800
When I asked him, he swore to heaven,

614
00:29:39,800 --> 00:29:40,720
swore a solemn oath,

615
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:42,450
that he never said those words.

616
00:29:42,560 --> 00:29:44,400
But guess what happened in court?

617
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:45,920
The other side had a recording.

618
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:47,560
I asked him, "Where did this recording come from?

619
00:29:47,560 --> 00:29:48,320
If you didn't say those words,

620
00:29:48,320 --> 00:29:49,160
where did the recording come from?"

621
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:51,080
He said he was possessed by aliens.

622
00:29:51,080 --> 00:29:51,880
Isn't that hilarious?

623
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:54,000
It's just unbelievable.

624
00:29:54,120 --> 00:29:54,640
That's why

625
00:29:54,640 --> 00:29:57,440
I say sometimes clients are only human at the time.

626
00:29:59,280 --> 00:30:00,640
Tell me something that makes you unhappy

627
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:02,300
to make me feel better. Quick.

628
00:30:05,560 --> 00:30:07,720
I told my client the other day,

629
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:08,960
"We have court tomorrow.

630
00:30:08,960 --> 00:30:10,080
Go to bed early tonight,

631
00:30:10,080 --> 00:30:11,960
because we have to be there early tomorrow morning."

632
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:12,960
He said no, I can't get up.

633
00:30:12,960 --> 00:30:13,880
He told me to go negotiate.

634
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:16,010
I said, how am I supposed to negotiate?

635
00:30:30,960 --> 00:30:32,760
I haven't even said I'm leaving.

636
00:30:33,160 --> 00:30:34,820
How come there's a new person?

637
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:36,250
Isn't this your friend?

638
00:30:38,640 --> 00:30:39,280
Thanks.

639
00:30:45,720 --> 00:30:47,720
I like arranging them this way.

640
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:49,440
It makes me comfortable.

641
00:30:49,480 --> 00:30:51,320
Who asked you to line them up for me?

642
00:30:51,320 --> 00:30:52,520
You look pretty upset.

643
00:30:52,520 --> 00:30:53,520
Drinking so much.

644
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:55,280
Is the case not going well?

645
00:30:55,280 --> 00:30:56,800
Your case is the one not going well.

646
00:30:56,800 --> 00:30:58,000
It wasn't going well.

647
00:30:59,120 --> 00:31:00,120
But it's resolved.

648
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:02,840
Stop pretending. What's resolved?

649
00:31:02,920 --> 00:31:04,760
You terminated the contract, right?

650
00:31:04,760 --> 00:31:06,000
I heard all about it.

651
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:08,920
Classic Lawyer Li.

652
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:12,330
Watching your client jump into a fire pit and doing nothing.

653
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:14,160
Let go of the urge to help.

654
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:15,560
Respect the fate of others.

655
00:31:15,560 --> 00:31:17,420
If the client can't see the truth,

656
00:31:17,800 --> 00:31:19,240
they have to pay the price.

657
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:20,320
This is their karma.

658
00:31:20,320 --> 00:31:22,040
What are you talking about?

659
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:24,720
Our profession as lawyers

660
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:26,920
is to intervene in other people's karma.

661
00:31:26,920 --> 00:31:27,640
Yes.

662
00:31:27,760 --> 00:31:30,560
People must be responsible for what they've done.

663
00:31:30,760 --> 00:31:33,200
But why should he be responsible for what he hasn't done?

664
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:36,240
This is the karma the law pursues.

665
00:31:36,280 --> 00:31:38,680
That scumbag did bad things,

666
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:40,080
so he should be punished.

667
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:40,760
Right?

668
00:31:40,760 --> 00:31:41,640
A scumbag?

669
00:31:41,920 --> 00:31:44,280
That's even less of a problem for a lawyer to solve.

670
00:31:44,280 --> 00:31:46,140
Why am I talking to you about this?

671
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:48,440
Alright, stop drinking.

672
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:49,570
Let me take you back.

673
00:31:50,000 --> 00:31:51,260
We've barely started.

674
00:31:55,640 --> 00:31:57,500
What are you doing? You scared me.

675
00:31:59,640 --> 00:32:00,440
Look.

676
00:32:00,640 --> 00:32:02,370
Zhou Huan went to a new company.

677
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:04,240
He will definitely repeat his old tricks.

678
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:06,000
As long as I get solid evidence,

679
00:32:06,640 --> 00:32:09,500
I don't believe Yu Huihui will still be so stubborn.

680
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:11,640
I have to call Dong Beihu.

681
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:13,240
You are really crazy.

682
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:14,920
Calling a Siberian tiger?

683
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:16,200
Isn't that an animal?

684
00:32:59,160 --> 00:33:01,480
Xin, you know we run a bathhouse ourselves.

685
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:03,160
Why did you come here and waste money?

686
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:05,000
What kind of place is yours, and what kind of place is this?

687
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:06,640
Are the baths the same?

688
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:07,200
Right.

689
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:11,000
A man needs to know how to make money and enjoy life.

690
00:33:11,520 --> 00:33:13,380
That's why you're a superior man.

691
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,040
What are you dawdling for?

692
00:33:40,040 --> 00:33:40,720
Well.

693
00:33:41,040 --> 00:33:42,760
I'm wearing a bit too much.

694
00:33:46,200 --> 00:33:46,920
Don't move.

695
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:48,800
What's wrong?

696
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:05,000
You've got a white hair.

697
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:06,440
Just pull it out.

698
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:07,240
Let's go.

699
00:34:07,440 --> 00:34:08,440
It's true.

700
00:34:09,159 --> 00:34:10,199
Time makes us old.

701
00:34:10,639 --> 00:34:12,170
Let's hurry and take a bath.

702
00:34:17,239 --> 00:34:19,920
I've recently realized

703
00:34:20,480 --> 00:34:23,159
that you're different from the old Dong Beihu.

704
00:34:23,159 --> 00:34:25,920
You know how to be modest and low-profile.

705
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:26,679
Yes.

706
00:34:26,719 --> 00:34:29,520
And you truly want to learn from me.

707
00:34:29,920 --> 00:34:31,239
I'm absolutely sincere.

708
00:34:31,239 --> 00:34:32,000
Xin.

709
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:33,239
Recently,

710
00:34:34,199 --> 00:34:35,920
I've gotten to know you all over again.

711
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:36,719
In the past,

712
00:34:36,719 --> 00:34:39,239
I treated you as a good brother and a good boss.

713
00:34:39,239 --> 00:34:41,159
Now you're my life mentor.

714
00:34:41,440 --> 00:34:43,199
Isn't there a famous saying?

715
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:46,719
A teacher for a day is a teacher for a lifetime.

716
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:47,929
You startled me.

717
00:34:48,320 --> 00:34:49,760
I thought you were going to mess up our seniority.

718
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:50,760
Could I be that stupid?

719
00:34:50,760 --> 00:34:52,090
Here, drink some water.

720
00:34:54,199 --> 00:34:55,719
I'm happy today.

721
00:34:55,920 --> 00:34:57,440
Let's not beat around the bush.

722
00:34:57,440 --> 00:35:00,000
Just tell me, which path should I lead you on?

723
00:35:01,160 --> 00:35:02,640
Look, there's no one here today.

724
00:35:02,640 --> 00:35:04,040
I'll tell you the truth.

725
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:07,600
I just want to know about the connections

726
00:35:07,600 --> 00:35:08,480
that got me out.

727
00:35:09,440 --> 00:35:11,040
I figured maybe in the future,

728
00:35:11,040 --> 00:35:12,240
someone will ask me for help.

729
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:13,640
Look, I can help people

730
00:35:13,640 --> 00:35:15,770
and make some money. How great is that?

731
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:17,760
Make what money?

732
00:35:18,480 --> 00:35:19,440
Make what money?

733
00:35:20,680 --> 00:35:21,480
I can make money from others.

734
00:35:21,480 --> 00:35:23,160
How could I make money from you?

735
00:35:23,160 --> 00:35:24,160
As for your matter,

736
00:35:24,160 --> 00:35:26,640
I did it specially for you.

737
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:28,160
I stopped doing that kind of work a long time ago.

738
00:35:28,160 --> 00:35:29,640
The 200,000 your mom gave me,

739
00:35:29,640 --> 00:35:31,170
I didn't keep a single cent.

740
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:41,240
No, no, no.

741
00:35:41,760 --> 00:35:43,360
I'm too excited. Xin.

742
00:35:43,640 --> 00:35:45,760
I really didn't expect you to be such a good friend.

743
00:35:45,760 --> 00:35:48,240
You didn't keep a single cent of the 200,000, right?

744
00:35:48,240 --> 00:35:48,760
Knowing you,

745
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:50,360
I must have accumulated good karma for eight lifetimes.

746
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:51,160
Xin, really.

747
00:35:51,520 --> 00:35:52,380
You flatter me.

748
00:35:58,240 --> 00:36:00,120
Hadouken.

749
00:36:02,120 --> 00:36:03,120
This kid.

750
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:08,720
The phone is ringing. Life is getting better.

751
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:10,760
I've been calling you all day. Why didn't you answer?

752
00:36:10,760 --> 00:36:11,890
I need to talk to you.

753
00:36:12,040 --> 00:36:13,520
I need to talk to you too.

754
00:36:13,520 --> 00:36:14,240
About what?

755
00:36:17,520 --> 00:36:18,200
Evidence.

756
00:36:18,920 --> 00:36:20,640
Evidence of that bastard Jia Xin's crimes.

757
00:36:20,640 --> 00:36:21,360
I got it on tape.

758
00:36:21,360 --> 00:36:22,760
I can call the police now.

759
00:36:24,080 --> 00:36:25,600
With such great news,

760
00:36:25,600 --> 00:36:27,120
shouldn't we celebrate?

761
00:36:28,600 --> 00:36:29,330
That's true.

762
00:36:29,560 --> 00:36:31,420
Let's go. I'll treat you to a meal.

763
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:33,720
Come on. I should be thanking you for this.

764
00:36:33,720 --> 00:36:34,920
I should be the one treating you.

765
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:36,560
I... I'll treat you.

766
00:36:36,560 --> 00:36:37,840
But... but if you insist on treating,

767
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:38,640
that's fine too.

768
00:36:38,640 --> 00:36:39,500
Okay. Let's go.

769
00:36:39,720 --> 00:36:41,180
You're too enthusiastic.

770
00:36:46,920 --> 00:36:48,520
What does it mean to endure hardships?

771
00:36:48,520 --> 00:36:51,760
What does it mean to never return until Loulan is defeated?

772
00:36:51,760 --> 00:36:54,800
What does it mean to never return until Loulan is defeated?

773
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:56,200
It's an ancient poem.

774
00:36:57,960 --> 00:37:00,560
Never return until Loulan is defeated, right?

775
00:37:00,720 --> 00:37:02,840
You're so educated, Brother Hu.

776
00:37:03,200 --> 00:37:04,400
I have to say, Brother Hu,

777
00:37:04,400 --> 00:37:06,480
you have both courage and strategy.

778
00:37:06,480 --> 00:37:08,040
You are truly brave and wise.

779
00:37:08,040 --> 00:37:09,240
A role model for our generation.

780
00:37:09,240 --> 00:37:11,970
These are just the tip of the iceberg of my merits.

781
00:37:13,240 --> 00:37:13,840
Let me tell you.

782
00:37:13,840 --> 00:37:15,240
You can't even imagine

783
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:17,000
how those bastards bossed me around.

784
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:19,280
They used all sorts of dirty tricks.

785
00:37:19,280 --> 00:37:20,120
I only had one move.

786
00:37:20,120 --> 00:37:22,240
Countering every move they made.

787
00:37:22,440 --> 00:37:24,480
Fortunately, I'm a versatile talent.

788
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:26,000
I handled all the work.

789
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:27,000
If you ask me,

790
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:29,520
it has to be a versatile talent like you, Brother Hu, right?

791
00:37:29,520 --> 00:37:30,440
You can adapt to any situation.

792
00:37:30,440 --> 00:37:31,700
No one else could do it.

793
00:37:33,840 --> 00:37:34,960
Then you should continue working tomorrow.

794
00:37:34,960 --> 00:37:35,840
No problem.

795
00:37:37,560 --> 00:37:38,360
Wait a minute.

796
00:37:38,880 --> 00:37:41,410
What are you talking about? Why should I work?

797
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:43,680
You've handled Jia Xin, right?

798
00:37:44,040 --> 00:37:44,800
What about Zhou Huan?

799
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:45,960
You have to step in too.

800
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:48,020
What does Zhou Huan have to do with me?

801
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:53,200
You're impossible to guard against.

802
00:37:53,200 --> 00:37:55,520
I was wondering why you were so kind to treat me to a meal.

803
00:37:55,520 --> 00:37:56,920
You were doing it for your own case all along.

804
00:37:56,920 --> 00:37:57,520
No.

805
00:37:57,520 --> 00:38:00,080
I thought such a small matter would be

806
00:38:00,080 --> 00:38:01,640
a piece of cake for you, Brother Hu.

807
00:38:01,640 --> 00:38:03,570
You can easily turn things around.

808
00:38:03,640 --> 00:38:05,760
If you go, won't you take them all down at once?

809
00:38:05,760 --> 00:38:07,200
Don't flatter me.

810
00:38:07,680 --> 00:38:09,680
Do you really think I'm stupid?

811
00:38:09,680 --> 00:38:10,600
If I show off again,

812
00:38:10,600 --> 00:38:12,080
I'll blow that 200,000.

813
00:38:12,160 --> 00:38:13,200
I'm definitely not going.

814
00:38:13,200 --> 00:38:14,530
What about the 180,000?

815
00:38:15,240 --> 00:38:17,160
The 180,000 is still in there.

816
00:38:17,160 --> 00:38:18,160
Don't you want it?

817
00:38:18,760 --> 00:38:19,720
My 180,000...

818
00:38:19,720 --> 00:38:21,040
I'll just go there tomorrow

819
00:38:21,040 --> 00:38:21,560
and tell him

820
00:38:21,560 --> 00:38:23,560
to withdraw it for me, and that's it.

821
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:25,240
You're too naive, Brother Hu.

822
00:38:25,240 --> 00:38:26,480
Do you think it's a bank?

823
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:28,160
It's a scam company.

824
00:38:28,160 --> 00:38:30,760
Do you think you can withdraw it just like that?

825
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:31,740
Think about it.

826
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:33,960
Did the chickens used for these roasted chicken frames

827
00:38:33,960 --> 00:38:35,800
practice bodybuilding before they died?

828
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,720
My teeth hurt so much from the meat stuck in them.

829
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:39,960
Then you should pay more attention to your health.

830
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:40,890
What do you mean?

831
00:38:40,960 --> 00:38:43,960
Do you know why people check a donkey's teeth when buying it?

832
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:45,820
To check its physical condition.

833
00:38:48,120 --> 00:38:49,720
Who are you calling a donkey?

834
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:51,600
You think you're so healthy?

835
00:38:51,640 --> 00:38:53,320
Your teeth are like a blender.

836
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:55,120
You can even chew bones, right?

837
00:38:55,120 --> 00:38:56,720
It doesn't relieve my anger.

838
00:38:56,800 --> 00:38:58,800
Why are you so mad at Xiaoxin?

839
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:01,280
Even criminals can hire lawyers.

840
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:02,800
This is common legal knowledge that even I know.

841
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:04,120
But he is a policeman's son.

842
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:05,200
And you are a lawyer's father.

843
00:39:05,200 --> 00:39:06,160
Don't you know that?

844
00:39:06,160 --> 00:39:06,920
Look at me.

845
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:09,600
I totally understand and support Xiaolong.

846
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:14,890
Lao Xiao.

847
00:39:16,400 --> 00:39:17,600
Isn't that Xiaolong?

848
00:39:18,040 --> 00:39:18,960
Who's that guy?

849
00:39:21,040 --> 00:39:22,440
Think about it, Brother Hu.

850
00:39:22,440 --> 00:39:25,640
Are you the only one scammed by this fraudulent company?

851
00:39:25,640 --> 00:39:27,720
There must be many other victims.

852
00:39:28,120 --> 00:39:30,000
When you make a move,

853
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:31,460
you can take them all down.

854
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:34,960
You won't just be the hero of Sister Pang's Bathhouse,

855
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:36,840
or the hero of our law firm.

856
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:39,640
You'll be the great hero of the entire Leyang City!

857
00:39:39,640 --> 00:39:42,760
You'll be upholding justice and eliminating evil for the people.

858
00:39:42,760 --> 00:39:43,480
Forget about eliminating evil.

859
00:39:43,480 --> 00:39:45,400
I'll just try not to be the evil.

860
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:46,840
Don't worry, I definitely won't go.

861
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:48,170
I... I can't do this job.

862
00:39:48,840 --> 00:39:50,900
I find you a bit stubborn, Brother Hu.

863
00:39:51,200 --> 00:39:52,320
Something got in my eye.

864
00:39:52,320 --> 00:39:53,480
No, no, don't rub it.

865
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:54,280
Don't rub it.

866
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:59,240
Come on, one, two, three.

867
00:40:04,200 --> 00:40:05,320
Slow down.

868
00:40:06,160 --> 00:40:08,840
No, since when did they become a thing?

869
00:40:09,320 --> 00:40:10,760
How would I know?

870
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:12,320
Alright.

871
00:40:12,880 --> 00:40:13,760
Don't touch it.

872
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:15,040
Your hands are dirty.

873
00:40:16,680 --> 00:40:17,840
This is my eyeball.

874
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:19,080
Are you blowing it like a birthday candle?

875
00:40:19,080 --> 00:40:20,410
Did you just make a wish?

876
00:40:20,800 --> 00:40:22,400
No. Does Xiaoxin know about this?

877
00:40:22,400 --> 00:40:23,960
How would I know?

878
00:40:28,600 --> 00:40:30,320
Think about it carefully.

879
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:31,480
Stop talking nonsense, okay?

880
00:40:31,480 --> 00:40:32,360
Whoever wants to do it can do it.

881
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:33,800
I can't do this, you know?

882
00:40:33,840 --> 00:40:34,800
I'm out of here.

883
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:47,440
This kid dares to show attitude to Xiaolong.

884
00:40:47,440 --> 00:40:48,640
Give it a rest.

885
00:40:49,840 --> 00:40:51,920
Based on my years of police experience,

886
00:40:51,920 --> 00:40:53,920
that kid looks like a little punk.

887
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:54,920
After so many years in the underworld,

888
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:56,320
do you think I can't tell?

889
00:40:56,320 --> 00:40:56,800
I'm telling you, Old Li.

890
00:40:56,800 --> 00:40:57,360
This won't work.

891
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,440
We have to step in.

892
00:40:59,080 --> 00:41:01,160
We must make Xiaoxin and Xiaolong make up.

893
00:41:01,160 --> 00:41:02,280
We can't let them have a falling out,

894
00:41:02,280 --> 00:41:03,280
or this kid will pop up

895
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:04,440
and take advantage of the situation.

896
00:41:04,440 --> 00:41:05,640
Absolutely not.

897
00:41:05,720 --> 00:41:06,920
Absolutely not.

898
00:41:19,640 --> 00:41:21,200
I'm really speechless.

899
00:41:21,440 --> 00:41:22,720
For this case I have on hand,

900
00:41:22,720 --> 00:41:24,640
I've been busy for months.

901
00:41:25,080 --> 00:41:26,400
The client heard from somewhere

902
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:28,280
that our team is just a bunch of pretty faces,

903
00:41:28,280 --> 00:41:29,880
and then terminated the contract with me.

904
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:32,810
Lawyer Li might feel good terminating the contract,

905
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:34,880
but our performance is gone too, isn't it?

906
00:41:34,880 --> 00:41:36,540
The client doesn't trust you.

907
00:41:37,200 --> 00:41:38,720
You should learn from Lawyer Li's mindset.

908
00:41:38,720 --> 00:41:39,560
Learn what?

909
00:41:39,560 --> 00:41:41,480
Learn how to terminate a contract with a client?

910
00:41:41,480 --> 00:41:42,040
Didn't I just learn that?

911
00:41:42,040 --> 00:41:43,840
I learned it, but what's the use?

912
00:41:43,840 --> 00:41:44,680
Here you go.

913
00:41:51,320 --> 00:41:52,580
You should get one too.

914
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:53,900
Are you kidding me?

915
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:55,850
Is the Shanyuan case ready?

916
00:41:56,000 --> 00:41:57,240
Just finished sorting it out.

917
00:41:57,240 --> 00:41:57,640
Good.

918
00:41:58,160 --> 00:41:58,760
Lawyer Li.

919
00:41:59,840 --> 00:42:01,770
I heard that for the Shanyuan case,

920
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:04,080
Lawyer Shen's team also wants to fight for it.

921
00:42:04,080 --> 00:42:06,200
And Lawyer Shen has already privately

922
00:42:06,200 --> 00:42:07,400
met with President Fan of Shanyuan

923
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:08,860
for drinks several times.

924
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:11,560
I was thinking if we could learn from it.

925
00:42:11,600 --> 00:42:13,200
Learn what? Drinking?

926
00:42:13,840 --> 00:42:14,680
We are all just pretty faces.

927
00:42:14,680 --> 00:42:15,810
We can't learn this.

928
00:42:20,640 --> 00:42:22,040
You should learn from it.

929
00:42:25,600 --> 00:42:26,640
I heard you.

930
00:42:31,400 --> 00:42:33,640
Aren't I just looking out for our team?

931
00:42:33,880 --> 00:42:35,920
Isn't this treating my kindness like dirt?

932
00:42:35,920 --> 00:42:36,680
If this continues,

933
00:42:36,680 --> 00:42:37,940
our team will be ruined

934
00:42:38,240 --> 00:42:39,240
and we'll have to disband.

935
00:42:39,240 --> 00:42:40,840
Then you should find a new one quickly.

936
00:42:40,840 --> 00:42:42,280
Am I that kind of person?

937
00:42:48,080 --> 00:42:48,920
Lawyer Qiu.

938
00:42:56,040 --> 00:42:57,040
Where is your Lawyer Li?
